@startuml
autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System
participant "Spotify" as Spotify

activate User

User -> System: asks to view an album
System -> Spotify: requests the album with its artists and tracks
Spotify --> System: returns the album data
alt album loaded
  System --> User: shows cover, title, artists, year, track count, type and tracks\nand the Save to Library / Remove from Library button
else error (network, expired session, not found, rate limit)
  System --> User: informs the error
end

note right of System
  If opened from a scan, the album is also
  added to the Recent list.
  The Library button depends on whether the
  album is already saved.
end note

@enduml
